<title>UK: Tate executive Paul Mirsky leaves.</title>
<headline>Tate executive Paul Mirsky leaves.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>British sweetener and animal feed producer Tate &amp; Lyle Plc said Paul Mirsky, managing director of its North American Sugar Division, was leaving the company.</p>
<p>The business units reporting to Mirsky will now report directly to Tate &amp; Lyle chief executive Larry Pillard, said the company in a statement.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
